From a1bc977a72accc9142dd1a540f7c8e2ea359c3b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:29:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: migrate type references using any prefix of an imported
 namespace

A namespace can be bound to more than one prefix on <definitions>. Map every
prefix bound to an import's namespace to the import name, so references
using the other prefixes are migrated too.
---
 src/migrateDiagram.js                    | 882 +++++++++++------------
 test/fixtures/imported-types-aliases.dmn |  10 +
 test/spec/migrateDiagramSpec.js          | 729 ++++++++++---------
 3 files changed, 824 insertions(+), 797 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 test/fixtures/imported-types-aliases.dmn

